# Offline oracle note — dfpt-gga-spin-finite-q-smearing (PW DFPT finite-q × spin × GGA × smear, Si at X)

## Intent

Pin finite-q (X = (1/2,0,0)) DFPT phonons for diamond Si with the **four-way
joint** collinear-spin × pure-GGA (PBE) × Fermi–Dirac metallic occupation
smearing response kernel on the plane-wave method — the product of shipped
parents `dfpt-gga-spin-smearing` (Γ, spin × PBE × FD),
`dfpt-gga-spin-finite-q-si` (X supercell, spin × PBE, fixed occ), and
`dfpt-finite-q-spin-smearing` (direct q, spin × LSDA × FD).

## Oracle status (2026-08-01) — CP2K RUN, offline

**CP2K 2026.1** (source rev `git:5e54ba2`, binary
`/nobackup/proj/disk/teoroo/personal/jicli594/work/cp2k/install/bin/cp2k.psmp`,
env `…/install/env.sh`, Arrhenius epyc login). CP2K has no PW-DFPT, so the
twin is `RUN_TYPE VIBRATIONAL_ANALYSIS` on the **2×1×1 supercell** (4 atoms)
with **LSD + MULTIPLICITY 1 + PBE + FERMI_DIRAC smear**: the supercell Γ FD
spectrum folds primitive Γ ∪ X, and the eigenvector phases identify the X
branch on the same spin×GGA×smear Hamiltonian class:

- Input: `inputs/dfpt-gga-spin-finite-q-smearing/si4_uks_pbe_smear_vib.inp`
  (LSD, MULTIPLICITY 1, PBE, FERMI_DIRAC ELECTRONIC_TEMPERATURE 3157.75 K
  ≡ degauss 0.02 Ry, ADDED_MOS 4, DZVP-MOLOPT-SR-GTH, GTH-PBE-q4, CUTOFF 300
  Ry, MP 1×2×2 on the supercell ≡ 2×2×2 on the primitive, `FULLY_PERIODIC T`,
  DX 0.01 bohr, `EPS_SCF 1e-8`).
- Run:
  ```bash
  source /nobackup/proj/disk/teoroo/personal/jicli594/work/cp2k/install/env.sh
  export OMP_NUM_THREADS=1
  # Keep the working directory outside harness /tmp wipe patterns.
  cd <stable_work_dir>
  ln -sf $CP2K_DATA_DIR/{BASIS_MOLOPT,GTH_POTENTIALS} .
  mpirun -np 1 cp2k.psmp -i si4_uks_pbe_smear_vib.inp -o out
  ```
- Output lines (9 modes; 3 translations projected out by CP2K):
  `VIB|Frequency (cm^-1)    98.223723           130.533918           364.045396`
  `VIB|Frequency (cm^-1)   427.180368           452.075468           458.190888`
  `VIB|Frequency (cm^-1)   536.999556           537.000981           541.694572`
  Modes 1–6 carry the X folding phase (unit cells out of phase) →
  **X branch: 98.22, 130.53 (TA doublet, FD-split — same systematic as the
  fixed-occ supercell parents), 364.05, 427.18 (LA/LO), 452.08, 458.19
  (TO) cm⁻¹**. Modes 7–9 = primitive Γ optical (537.00, 537.00, 541.69).
  Matches the fixed-occ spin×GGA supercell twin at M = 0 to the expected
  gapped-smear digit.
- Wall (serial, 1 MPI × OMP=1): **585.9 s**. ATV DFPT twin regression:
  **148.1 s** (serial) → fair ratio r = T_atv/T_cp2k = **0.25** (≤ 10).

The GPW GTH/MOLOPT representation differs from the ATV NC-UPF 10 Ry PW twin
(Γ-only supercell mesh), so the CP2K numbers anchor the **physics windows**
(|ω| low 3 ∈ [50, 400], high 3 ∈ [300, 850] cm⁻¹ — the family windows that
contain both engines), not the digit. The sharp same-Hamiltonian gate is
below.

## Sharp pin (same Hamiltonian, free-energy path)

Central second difference of the **collinear-spin PBE free energy** under
Fermi–Dirac smear on the **2×1×1 supercell** (h = 0.03 Å on supercell atom-0
x, SCF tol 1e-9, `mix_beta` 0.3, identical ecut/k/XC/UPF/spin/FD):

- F₀ = −15.121055430501 Ha, F(+h) = −15.120904142901 Ha,
  F(−h) = −15.120505520962 Ha (each converged in 44 iters, mag=0;
  \|TS\| ~ 2e-15 Ry ⇒ F=E)
- C[(0x),(0x)] = (F⁺ − 2F⁰ + F⁻)/h² = **21.2006 eV/Å²**
  (digit-identical to the fixed-occ supercell parent pin)

DFPT supercell diagonal at regression settings: **21.1911 eV/Å²**
(|Δ| vs 21.2006 ≈ 0.04 %); regression gate |Δ| ≤ 0.30 eV/Å². M = 0
gapped-FD identity vs fixed-occ parent DFPT C00 21.1911: exact at 4 decimals
(tol 0.05).

Both measured 2026-08-01 (Release, this host, OMP=1) with an independent
energy-only path (`PW::run` on `expand_supercell(frame, 2, 1, 1)`), not the
DFPT solver. ctest never launches CP2K; the regression hard-codes the
numbers (`REFERENCE.md`).

## Twin settings (match regression)

| Item | Value |
| ---- | ----- |
| Cell | diamond Si, a = 5.43 Å, 2-atom fcc primitive → 2×1×1 supercell for C00 FD |
| PP | `tests/data/pw/Si_lda_nc.upf` (in-tree NC ONCV) |
| XC | PBE (pure GGA; joint spin kernel via FD of the spin-GGA XC operator) |
| Spin | collinear, multiplicity = 1 (M = 0) |
| Smear | Fermi–Dirac, degauss = 0.02 Ry, extra_bands = 0 |
| ecut | 10 Ry |
| k-mesh | 1×1×1 on the supercell (Γ+X of primitive folded) |
| q | X = (1/2, 0, 0) → commensurate 2×1×1 supercell Γ-DFPT |
